  "note": "Triennial election of the Warrenpoint Urban District Council (whole council, two wards), due 15 January 1932. There was no poll: East Ward had five nominations for five seats and in West Ward four of the eleven nominees withdrew, leaving seven for seven. Five candidates for five seats, returned unopposed. Party labels are not printed against the names. Returned unopposed."
